  "bio": "Juli Gros is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Vladivostok, Russia, specializing in the intricate black and gray, as well as dotwork styles. With an impressive portfolio that showcases a unique blend of precision and creativity, Juli's work stands out through meticulous attention to detail and an unmistakable artistic touch. Clients rave about Juli's exceptional talent, which is evident in each personalized tattoo design that comes to life under their steady hand.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Vladivostok, Far Eastern Federal District, Russia\n\n▪Художник\n▪TATTOO ARTIST from Vladivostok  \n▪#NEOJAPAN 👺\n▪Мои работы 👉🏼 #grostattoo\n▪WhatsApp 👇🏼",
